{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resume","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a pack resumes after being suspended, it may begin by iterating over the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already downloaded resources. As a result, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" structure’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"countOfResourcesCompleted"},{"type":"text","text":" field may revert to 0 before rapidly returning to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the level of progress at the time the pack was suspended."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To temporarily suspend downloading, call the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-suspend"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/resume"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resume","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack(im)resume","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"resume","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resume","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Resumes downloading if the pack is inactive.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["